The first-parent main commit that adds this marker is the minimum API rollback
version after the API stopped writing piLaunchConfig.apiFirstTurn (release 7).
The installed Release 7 CLI rejects that slot through its strict launch schema.
The Runner's generated PiLaunchConfig tolerates unknown fields, and the Guest
no longer parses the launch config. Older APIs write the slot on every Pi run
and require it when decoding queued contexts. See docs/deployment-compatibility.md.
